><p>37 + 2 = 39</p><p>39 + 4 = 43</p><p>43 + 8 = <b>51</b></p><p>51 + 16 = 67</p><p>Hence, missing term = 51</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Logic for the given series  - </p><p>36 + 1 = 37</p><p>37 + 2 = 39</p><p>39 + 4 = 43</p><p>43 + 8 = <b>51</b></p><p>51 + 16 = 67</p><p>Hence, missing term = 51</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Which of the following numbers will replace the question mark (?) in the given series?</p><p>49, 64, 81, 100, 121, ?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344;-&#2360;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2342;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2358;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344; (?) &#2325;&#2379; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2346;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2327;&#2368;?</p><p>49, 64, 81, 100, 121, ?</p>", "options_en": ["151", "129", "124", "144"], "options_hi": ["151", "129", "124", "144"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>The pattern is as follows:</p><p>7 * 7 = 49</p><p>8 * 8 = 64</p><p>9 * 9 = 81</p><p>10 * 10 = 100</p><p>11 * 11 = 121</p><p>So,</p><p>12 * 12 = 144</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>The pattern is as follows:</p><p>7 * 7 = 49</p><p>8 * 8 = 64</p><p>9 * 9 = 81</p><p>10 * 10 = 100</p><p>11 * 11 = 121</p><p>So,</p><p>12 * 12 = 144</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Which number will replace the question mark (?) in the following series?</p><p>37, 45, ?, 136, 261, 477</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2358;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344; (?) &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344; &#2346;&#2352; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344;-&#2360;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2310;&#2